  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Death Backup 是一個模組，會在玩家死亡前將物品欄儲存到世界資料夾中的檔案裡。如果玩家擁有管理員權限，可以透過 '<em>/deathbackup load &lt;index&gt;</em>' 指令重新載入物品欄。'<em>/deathbackup list</em>' 會顯示所有最近的死亡記錄及可擷取的索引編號。物品欄會儲存在以玩家名稱命名的資料夾中，因此無論是在伺服器環境還是單人遊戲都能運作。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依套件\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendBackupReminderMessageToThoseWithAccessOnDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，當玩家死亡且擁有管理員權限時，會發送訊息告知已建立備份並可進行載入。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>backupReminderMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"您的死亡前物品欄備份已建立，可使用 '/deathbackup load 0' 載入。\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當 'sendBackupReminderMessageToThoseWithAccessOnDeath' 啟用時，發送給擁有管理員權限玩家的訊息。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/deathbackup</em> - 顯示可用的指令列表。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/deathbackup list</em> - 顯示最近死亡記錄及對應索引。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/deathbackup load &lt;index&gt;</em> - 載入 '<em>/deathbackup list</em>' 中由 <em>&lt;index&gt;</em> 指定的死亡備份。索引 0 永遠是最新的死亡記錄。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每次玩家死亡時，其物品欄與裝備都會儲存至 '<em>./world-folder/data/deathbackup/time.txt</em>'。預設情況下，若玩家擁有管理員權限，系統會發送提醒訊息，但可在設定中關閉此功能。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 '<em>/deathbackup list</em>' 指令即可查看所有近期的死亡備份。索引 0 永遠為最新的一筆。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 '<em>/deathbackup load 0</em>' 指令來載入最近一次死亡前的最新物品欄。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">另一個包含具有 NBT 標籤物品的範例，例如附魔道具與書寫書籍：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過執行 '<em>/deathbackup load 0</em>' 即可順利載入最後一份物品欄。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/death-backup/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"623\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論數量過多且分散在各個模組頁面，我已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、點子、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 倉庫</a> 回報。感謝您！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
